# The policy lane's first arm (log 2026-09-11): a one-shot read at
# sample 2,000 -- if our worth is at or below 80 percent of the
# strongest rival's, the whole army commits for the rest of the match
# (waves force-released, marching). The trigger was priced before the
# arm: worth/rival at that window rank-AUCs 0.912 against entering the
# attrition regime, where every fixed lever measured flat AFTER the
# lock (0-for-5, mechanisms verified); this acts BEFORE it, on the
# ~21 percent of alive-at-window matches the champion wins only 29
# percent of. One field off the champion (press 80).
